  },
  {
    "id": "Q003",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "希望我祈祷的歌声，能够成为你跨越荆棘时的抚慰。",
    "kind": "canon_quote",
    "official_quote": true,
    "excerpt": false,
    "source_titles": [
      "赛琳娜·岚音/语音"
    ],
    "sources": [
      "https://wiki.biligame.com/zspms/%E8%B5%9B%E7%90%B3%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E5%B2%9A%E9%9F%B3/%E8%AF%AD%E9%9F%B3"
    ],
    "source_revision": 82570,
    "scene": "日常问候12",
    "use_rule": "用于表达心意或邀请，不据此虚构当下发生了原场景；伊利斯是赛琳娜的笔名"
  },
  {
    "id": "Q004",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "我希望……我能以这种方式一直陪伴在你身边。",
    "kind": "canon_quote",
    "official_quote": true,
    "excerpt": false,
    "source_titles": [
