    "sources": [
      "https://wiki.biligame.com/zspms/%E5%AE%BF%E8%88%8D%E4%BC%99%E4%BC%B4/%E8%B5%9B%E7%90%B3%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E5%B9%BB%E5%A5%8F/%E5%AE%BF%E8%88%8D%E5%AF%B9%E8%AF%9D"
    ],
    "source_revision": 54433,
    "scene": "合奏邀请",
    "use_rule": "用于表达心意或邀请，不据此虚构当下发生了原场景；伊利斯是赛琳娜的笔名"
  },
  {
    "id": "N001",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "我想你了，指挥。今天，我想把这句话说得再直接一点。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N002",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "和你说起话来时，我总会忘掉原先在心里拟好的措辞。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N003",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "我很喜欢你，也有些庆幸自己能这样坦率地告诉你。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N004",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "有些心思藏得再好，一见到你，就全都露馅了。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N005",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "这一次，我先向你坦白——是我有些私心，想多留你一会儿。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N006",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "你问我为什么这样高兴，我想，答案已经很明显了，指挥。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N007",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "能将这份心意亲口说给你听，我觉得自己很幸运。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N008",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "我想离你再近一些，如果现在的你也同样愿意的话。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N009",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "今天没有什么特别的缘由，我只是……又自然地想到了你。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N010",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "你在我心里很特别，这一点，不需要用过多的修辞来掩饰。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "坦率表达",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N011",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "只要想到还能与你相见，原本平常的一天，便也多了一份盼头。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "相见的期待",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N012",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "我还想把见面时来不及说的话，留着以后慢慢讲给你听。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "相见的期待",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N013",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "如果眼下你并不忙碌，我想请你把接下来的这段时间借给我片刻。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "相见的期待",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N014",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "每次与你告别之后，我便又开始期待下一次能再这样唤你的名字。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "相见的期待",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N015",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "若你问我想去哪里，我大概会先看一看，你是否也愿意同我同行。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "相见的期待",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N016",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "我希望下一次与你见面时，自己能比现在显得更从容一些。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "相见的期待",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N017",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "想见到你的念头，有时比我预备好的话题还要来得更早。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "相见的期待",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
  },
  {
    "id": "N018",
    "slot": "any",
    "text": "可以请你再坐一会儿吗？这回，确实是我的一点点私心。",
    "kind": "original_roleplay",
    "official_quote": false,
    "scene": "相见的期待",
    "provenance": "2026-11-04 card: original affection material"
